    {
        "content": "<p>And then the second claim from the AI is</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/digama0/lean4lean/pull/50\">digama0/lean4lean#50</a>: \"<code>IsDefEqU.weakN_iff</code> (definitional-equality strengthening) is false as stated\"</p>\n</blockquote>",
