        "content": "<p>Oh, and the same problem that affects <code>abstract_eq</code> in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/48\">#48</a> also affects <code>instantiate_eq</code>. I'll update both <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/48\">#48</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/49\">#49</a> to reflect that.</p>",
